@everyone 
The inky black depths of the the Night Time Thames River: 
A ship with no crew, encrusted with ice and salt sails itself into the port of London. The Irish have arrived. Beware the wrath of a prankster god named Lugh, trickster of the Irish Isle.

@everyone Amara has been spending most of the day talking to crew members. You see her running around the vessel gathering random supplies. Feeling prepared, she finds the largest gathering of people to make her announcement. 
"Attention everyone! I would like to have Sea Shanty night on the island tonight! (7pm pst) There will be music, dancing, food and fun! Everyone is invited. We need time to take a deep breath and enjoy life while we have it." 
(I will be playing music on groovy in voice chat and I would love to see everyone join for some stress free rp.)
